{
  "slug": "mentor",
  "name": "Mentor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Mentor is an inline prompt coaching plugin for Claude Code. It watches every prompt before it reaches Claude and, when it spots something worth flagging, injects a short coaching note so Claude surfaces it at the top of its response.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `mentor` (Configure the inline coaching system), `mentor-recap` (Analyzes your cross-session Claude usage patterns from the interaction log (~/.claude/coaching/interactions.jsonl) and user model (~/.claude/coaching/user-model.json))\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mentor@claude-community` from `ShawnCholeva/mentor`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 2
  },
